== PART A: PREMISE AND THE REGEX MODEL OF R (libpcre2-8 10.46 2025-08-27; callout after the regex)
  A0 `(?:(\d);)*(?C"r")` on `7;3;`: WHOLE HOLDS, group 1 at the callout = '3' (expect '3') OK
  A0 `(?:(\d);)*(?C"r")` on ``: WHOLE HOLDS, group 1 at the callout = None (expect None) OK
  A0 `(?:(\d)?;)*(?C"r")` on `7;;`: WHOLE HOLDS, group 1 at the callout = '7' (expect '7') OK
  A0 `(?:(\d)?;)*(?C"r")` on `3;;`: WHOLE HOLDS, group 1 at the callout = '3' (expect '3') OK
  A0 `(?:(\d)?;)*(?C"r")` on `;`: WHOLE HOLDS, group 1 at the callout = None (expect None) OK
  (A0 rows 3-4: a pass that does not set the label CARRIES the earlier pass's value: R reads `7` on `7;;`, the
   last pass that SET h, not the last pass; the engine's R reads the same capture state.)

